nt on my card payment looks wrong, the exchange rate must be off.\", \"My ATM withdrawal abroad used a bad exchange rate.\",\n    \"The rate for my cash withdrawal in dollars was wrong.\", \"Why was the exchange rate on my withdrawal so poor?\",\n    \"I think the exchange rate you used for my purchase was incorrect.\", \"The amount taken for my cash withdrawal looks wrong because of the rate.\",\n    # account_security\n    \"I forgot the passcode for the app.\", \"How can I change my app passcode?\", \"My passcode isn't accepted anymore.\",\n    \"Reset passcode\", \"Why do I have to verify who I am?\", \"I can't get my identity verified.\", \"My ID check keeps failing.\",\n    \"How do I update my personal information?\", \"I want to cancel my account.\", \"My phone has been stolen.\",\n    \"What is the minimum age to sign up?\", \"Can I use the service if I live in Brazil?\", \"Where can I see my verification status?\",\n    # cards\n    \"When will my card get here?\", \"Can you send my card to another address?\", \"How do I start using my new card?\",\n    \"My card was swallowed by the ATM.\", \"My card isn't working at all.\", \"I need to replace my damaged card.\",\n    \"Can I get a virtual card for online shopping?\", \"Apple Pay won't work with my card.\", \"Contactless payments keep failing.\",\n    \"My card was stolen yesterday.\", \"Is my card Visa or Mastercard?\", \"How many disposable cards can I have?\",\n    \"I still haven't received my card.\", \"Can I have more than one card?\", \"My card expired, how do I get a new one?\",\n    \"Where can I find my card number?\", \"How do I freeze my lost card?\",\n    # disputes\n    \"There's a payment on my account I don't recognise.\", \"I have been charged twice for one purchase.\",\n    \"Why did my card payment get declined?\", \"The ATM declined my card.\", \"My card payment is still pending after a week.\",\n    \"I want a refund for an item I returned.\", \"My refund still hasn't arrived.\", \"W